Control your movements to increase your defenses. This allows you to shrug off minor damage and, if you have a shield equipped, preemptively Block in reaction to incoming damage.

While this talent is activated, you are globally slowed by [17%, 12%, 9.5%, 7.7%, 6.4% (TL1-5)] and all damage you take is reduced by a flat [9.6, 13, 16, 18, 20 (TL1-5; DEX 100; LUCK 100)].

If you have a shield equipped and Block is not on cooldown, any blockable damage that is greater than 33% of your block value (before resistances) will have a [17%, 24%, 29%, 32%, 36% (TL1-5)] chance to instantly activate Block.

The flat damage reduction will increase with your defense.
